         unrelated groups of settings and only one of them is being discarded. -->
    <string name="onehand_sector_unresolved">⚠ Unrecognised target: %1$s</string>
    <string name="onehand_edge_reset_button">Reset to default (both edge menus)</string>
    <string name="onehand_edge_reset_caption">Throws away the sector actions you picked yourself and goes back to the order built into the app. Both handles at once — the layout was designed as one set. Only the edge menus: the stars, the floating button, the Home swipes and the activation setting are left alone.</string>
    <string name="onehand_edge_reset_title">Reset both edge menus?</string>
    <string name="onehand_edge_reset_message">The %1$d edge-menu sectors you set yourself are deleted from this phone — the left handle and the right one. Nothing else holds a copy, so this cannot be undone.\n\nEvery sector goes back to the order built into the app, and keeps following it through future updates instead of staying pinned to today\'s.\n\nNOT touched: the Home-screen stars, the floating button and where you dragged it, the four Home swipes, how the handles are activated, and the One-Hand on/off switch.</string>
    <string name="onehand_edge_reset_confirm">Reset</string>
    <string name="onehand_edge_reset_done">%1$d sector overrides cleared — both edge menus follow the built-in order again</string>

    <!-- Configs > Profile > Connect > Vault configs + Imported tab (#566/#569) -->
    <string name="vault_connect_header">Vault configs</string>
    <string name="vault_connect_caption">Fetch your consolidated vault configs: mesh, mail, AI, git, about, autocomplete. Two factors. The stored Authelia bearer above asks the server to mail a one-time code to your account address, and the bearer plus that code fetch the bundle. What arrives is shown in the Imported tab and is NOT applied to any app. It stays in memory until the app closes, so nothing is written to this device\'s storage.</string>
    <string name="vault_connect_fetch">2 · Fetch vault configs</string>
